# Large test and output directories
test-output/
cmd/capture/webui/frontend/node_modules/
cmd/capture/webui/frontend/.next/

# The web UI bundle is built inside the image by the "frontend" stage in
# docker/service/Dockerfile, so a locally built copy must not enter the context.
# Excluding it is what makes the image reproducible rather than dependent on the
# state of the machine doing the build: without this line a stale dist/ is
# copied in by `COPY . .` and only overwritten if the COPY --from ordering is
# right, which is too subtle to rely on.
#
# Note these patterns are anchored at the context root -- the bare "dist/" above
# does NOT match this path, which is why it needs spelling out in full (the same
# reason node_modules is listed with its full path).
cmd/capture/webui/frontend/dist/

# Same reasoning for the generated protobuf types: gitignored, regenerated from
# netcap.proto inside the builder stage, and excluded here so a local copy
# cannot be embedded into the image instead.
types/netcap.pb.go

# Cursor history
.cursor/